ndian food, loved it my whole life.'}, {'start': 57.099998474121094, 'end': 58.41999816894531, 'text': " So we're in Edinburgh, I'm with my friends,"}, {'start': 58.439998626708984, 'end': 59.2599983215332, 'text': " they're like, where are we going?"}, {'start': 59.2599983215332, 'end': 60.099998474121094, 'text': ' Trevor, what do you say?'}, {'start': 60.099998474121094, 'end': 60.91999816894531, 'text': " I'm like, Indian food."}, {'start': 60.91999816894531, 'end': 61.7599983215332, 'text': " They're like, every time?"}, {'start': 61.7599983215332, 'end': 63.439998626708984, 'text': ' I was like, yes, every time, Indian food.'}, {'start': 63.439998626708984, 'end': 64.27999877929688, 'text': " I'm like, no, it's the same."}, {'start': 64.27999877929688, 'end': 65.27999877929688, 'text': " I'm like, then why do you keep asking me?"}, {'start': 65.27999877929688, 'end': 67.18000030517578, 'text': ' If you know, you know, stop asking me.'}, {'start': 68.95999908447266, 'end': 71.19999694824219, 'text': ' And I searched, I searched for where we were gonna go'}, {'start': 71.19999694824219, 'end': 73.12000274658203, 'text': ' because I always try and find the most authentic'}, {'start': 73.12000274658203, 'end': 74.36000061035156, 'text': ' Indian restaurant I can find.'}, {'start': 74.36000061035156, 'end': 77.80000305175781, 'text': ' Like, I mean like authentic Indian restaurants.'}, {'start': 77.80000305175781, 'end': 78.63999938964844, 'text': ' Do you know what I mean?'}, {'start': 78.63999938964844, 'end': 80.37999725341797, 'text': " So what I'll do is I'll go to a place"}, {'start': 80.37999725341797, 'end': 82.76000213623047, 'text': " and then I'll ask around and I'll ask people."}, {'start': 82.76000213623047, 'end': 83.72000122070312, 'text': " I'll be like, where do you go?"}, {'start': 83.72000122070312, 'end': 85.04000091552734, 'text': ' And then like, where the white people tell me,'}, {'start': 85.04000091552734, 'end': 85.87999725341797, 'text': 