y!"}, {'start': 134.1199951171875, 'end': 135.1999969482422, 'text': ' Damn it, mommy.'}, {'start': 140.0, 'end': 143.16000366210938, 'text': ' I was like, oh, but Thiessen, is it bad?'}, {'start': 144.32000732421875, 'end': 145.83999633789062, 'text': " I don't even know anymore."}, {'start': 146.66000366210938, 'end': 148.5800018310547, 'text': ' I lost perspectives.'}, {'start': 150.3000030517578, 'end': 151.5800018310547, 'text': ' Here, you can have it.'}, {'start': 152.66000366210938, 'end': 155.27999877929688, 'text': ' And he gave me his curry sandwich.'}, {'start': 157.74000549316406, 'end': 158.5800018310547, 'text': ' I bit it.'}, {'start': 161.5399932861328, 'end': 163.77999877929688, 'text': ' And Toronto, there are moments in your life'}, {'start': 167.05999755859375, 'end': 168.82000732421875, 'text': ' that will forever shape who you are.'}, {'start': 171.05999755859375, 'end': 174.77999877929688, 'text': ' Moments that will define who you grow on to be.'}, {'start': 174.8000030517578, 'end': 176.36000061035156, 'text': ' This was one of those moments for me.'}, {'start': 176.36000061035156, 'end': 178.9600067138672, 'text': ' I put that sandwich in my mouth.'}, {'start': 178.9600067138672, 'end': 182.1999969482422, 'text': ' I bit down, and my mouth came alive.'}, {'start': 182.1999969482422, 'end': 185.27999877929688, 'text': ' My tongue discovered its purpose.'}, {'start': 185.27999877929688, 'end': 188.0, 'text': " I didn't know potatoes could pop like that."}, {'start': 188.0, 'end': 190.60000610351562, 'text': ' The flavors were bouncing around.'}, {'start': 190.60000610351562, 'end': 192.44000244140625, 'text': ' My eyes opened wide.'}, {'start': 193.83999633789062, 'end': 196.9199981689453, 'text': ' It was, I just, I was like, wow, I was like, curry!'}, {'start': 199.44000244140625, 'end': 200.5, 'text': ' Thank you, mommy.'}, {'start': 202.60000610351562, 'end': 203.44000244140625, 'text': ' It was perfect.'}, {'start': 205.75999450683594, 'end': 207.39999389648438, 'text': " And since then, I've loved curry."}, {'start': 208.36000061035156, 'end': 209.8800048828125, 'text': ' So, fast forward many decades.'}, {'start': 209.8800048828125, 'end': 211.55999755859375, 'text': " We're in Edinburgh, Scotland."}, {'start': 211.55999755859375, 'end': 212.8000030517578, 'text': ' Going out with my friends.'}, {'start': 212.8000030517578, 'end': 213.63999938964844, 'text': " We're choosing a spot."}, {'start': 213.63999938964844, 'end': 215.27999877929688, 'text': ' I choose Indian, authentic Indian.'}, {'start': 215.27999877929688, 'end': 217.9199981689453, 'text': " We get to the place, and it's legit."}, {'start': 217.9199981689453, 'end': 218.75999450683594, 'text': ' Like, it is legit.'}, {'start': 218.75999450683594, 'end': 221.55999755859375, 'text': " We walk in, and there's Indian music playing."}, {'start': 221.55999755859375, 'end': 222.72000122070312, 'text': ' There are Indian people eating.'}, {'start': 222.72000122070312, 'end': 224.63999938964844, 'text': ' Indian cooks in the back, Indian waiters,'}, {'start': 224.63999938964844, 'end': 225.9199981689453, 'text': ' Indian guards on the wall.'}, {'start': 225.9199981689453, 'end': 227.24000549316406, 'text': " I'm like, this is it."}, {'start': 227.24000549316406, 'end': 228.0800018310547, 'text': " I'm home."}, {'start': 229.60000610351562, 'end': 231.52000427246094, 'text': ' We walked in, we sat down.'}, {'start': 231.52000427246094, 'end': 233.75999450683594, 'text': ' And as soon as we sat, one of my friends, Steve,'}, {'start': 234.4600067138672, 'end': 235.4199981689453, 'text': ' launches for the menu.'}, {'start': 235.4199981689453, 'end': 237.3800048828125, 'text': " And I was like, Steve, Steve, it's cool, man."}, {'start': 237.3800048828125, 'end': 239.5, 'text': " I'll just order for everyone at the table."}, {'start': 239.5, 'end': 241.02000427246094, 'text': " And he's like, oh, oh, that's fine, Trevor."}, {'start': 241.02000427246094, 'end': 243.22000122070312, 'text': " I'll just, I'll order for myself, thank you."}, {'start': 243.22000122070312, 'end': 245.5, 'text': " I was like, no, no, it's not about that, Steve."}, {'start': 245.5, 'end': 247.89999389648438, 'text': ' I just prefer to order for all of us, yeah?'}, {'start': 247.89999389648438, 'end': 249.4199981689453, 'text': ' Right, you good?'}, {'start': 249.4199981689453, 'end': 252.22000122070312, 'text': " He's like, uh, I don't know why that's necessary."}, {'start': 252.22000122070312, 'end': 254.22000122070312, 'text': " I think I'll just order for myself."}, {'start': 254.22000122070312, 'end': 255.05999755859375, 'text': ' Is that okay?'}, {'start': 255.05999755859375, 'end': 257.4200134277344, 'text': " I was like, uh, it's not, no, it's not okay, Steve."}, {'start': 258.3399963378906, 'end': 259.5, 'text': " It's not okay, right?"}, {'start': 259.5, 'end': 261.5400085449219, 'text': " Because you're probably gonna say some shit"}, {'start': 261.55999755859375, 'end': 264.20001220703125, 'text': " that's gonna embarrass me in front of my Indian people,"}, {'start': 264.20001220703125, 'end': 265.0400085449219, 'text': ' right?'}, {'start': 265.0400085449219, 'end': 267.1199951171875, 'text': ' And so I just need you to back off for a moment.'}, {'start': 267.1199951171875, 'end': 268.3599853515625, 'text': " He's like, I'm sorry, what would I say"}, {'start': 268.3599853515625, 'end': 270.67999267578125, 'text': ' that could embarrass you in front of Indian people?'}, {'start': 270.67999267578125, 'end': 273.0799865722656, 'text': " I was like, I don't know Steve and I don't want it to happen."}, {'start': 273.0799865722656, 'end': 274.3999938964844, 'text': ' Just let me handle this, okay?'}, {'start': 274.3999938964844, 'end': 276.0, 'text': " He's like, let you handle this?"}, {'start': 276.0, 'end': 278.0400085449219, 'text': " Trevor, I'll have you know that I've eaten curry"}, {'start': 278.0400085449219, 'end': 279.239990234375, 'text': ' for many, many years.'}, {'start': 279.239990234375, 'end': 280.6000061035156, 'text': " I'm like, Steve, this is not the time."}, {'start': 280.6000061035156, 'end': 281.9599914550781, 'text': " Just, let's not argue, okay?"}, {'start': 281.9599914550781, 'end': 283.32000732421875, 'text': " Let's not argue, it's not the time to argue."}, {'start': 283.32000732421875, 'end': 284.1600036621094, 'text': " He's like, what do you mean?"}, {'start': 284.1600036621094, 'end': 285.9200134277344, 'text': ' Why would I embarrass you, why?'}, {'start': 285.9200134277344, 'end': 287.6400146484375, 'text': " I was like, there's no, you don't need to know why."}, {'start': 287.6400146484375, 'end': 288.55999755859375, 'text': " Let's just not do."}, {'start': 288.55999755859375, 'end': 289.3999938964844, 'text': " He's like, no, why, why?"}, {'start': 291.67999267578125, 'end': 293.20001220703125, 'text': ' All right?'}, {'start': 293.20001220703125, 'end': 294.94000244140625, 'text': " I wasn't gonna bring up race, but you did, Steve."}, {'start': 294.94000244140625, 'end': 296.5400085449219, 'text': " And now that you brought it up, let's talk about it."}, {'start': 296.5400085449219, 'end': 299.4200134277344, 'text': ' Every time I take my white friends to an ethnic restaurant,'}, {'start': 299.4200134277344, 'end': 301.239990234375, 'text': ' they always say some shit that embarrasses me.'}, {'start': 301.239990234375, 'end': 303.760009765625, 'text': ' Every single time, every time.'}, {'start': 303.760009765625, 'end': 305.5199890136719, 'text': " Either they don't know how to pronounce the food"}, {'start': 305.5199890136719, 'end': 306.79998779296875, 'text': " or they'll say some random shit."}, {'start': 306.79998779296875, 'end': 308.760009765625, 'text': " They'll be like, can I get that one, the papadums?"}, {'start': 308.760009765625, 'end': 310.239990234375, 'text': ' What do you call these ones?'}, {'start': 310.239990234375, 'end': 311.67999267578125, 'text': " You know, they'll be like, can I get this one,"}, {'start': 311.67999267578125, 'end': 312.8399963378906, 'text': ' but not spicy?'}, {'start': 312.8399963378906, 'end': 313.67999267578125, 'text': ' Kill yourself!'}, {'start': 315.55999755859375, 'end': 317.3599853515625, 'text': ' Can I get the curry, but not spicy?'}, {'start': 317.3599853515625, 'end': 318.20001220703125, 'text': ' Kill yourself!'}, {'start': 318.8999938964844, 'end': 320.7799987792969, 'text': ' How are you gonna ask for curry, but not spicy?'}, {'start': 320.7799987792969, 'end': 322.29998779296875, 'text': ' Your forefathers went around the world'}, {'start': 322.29998779296875, 'end': 323.3800048828125, 'text': ' killing people for the spice.'}, {'start': 323.3800048828125, 'end': 324.5, 'text': " Now you don't want it?"}, {'start': 329.5, 'end': 331.1400146484375, 'text': ' Shut up and eat the spice, Steve.'}, {'start': 333.1400146484375, 'end': 334.3800048828125, 'text': " And he's there, he's like, Trevor, okay,"}, {'start': 334.3800048828125, 'end': 336.4599914550781, 'text': " I really don't understand where this is coming from."}, {'start': 336.4599914550781, 'end': 337.29998779296875, 'text': ' All right?'}, {'start': 337.29998779296875, 'end': 338.1400146484375, 'text': " I'm not gonna embarrass you."}, {'start': 338.1400146484375, 'end': 338.9800109863281, 'text': ' I understand curry.'}, {'start': 338.9800109863281, 'end': 340.17999267578125, 'text': " I was like, Steve, let's just leave it at that."}, {'start': 340.17999267578125, 'end': 341.0199890136719, 'text': ' I got you, okay?'}, {'start': 341.0199890136719, 'end': 341.8399963378906, 'text': ' I got you.'}, {'start': 341.8399963378906, 'end': 342.67999267578125, 'text': ' All right?'}, {'start': 342.67999267578125, 'end': 343.5, 'text': ' I understand this way more than you.'}, {'start': 343.5, 'end': 344.3399963378906, 'text': " He's like, Trevor, I'm sorry."}, {'start': 344.3399963378906, 'end': 346.05999755859375, 'text': " You're not more Indian than me."}, {'start': 346.0799865722656, 'end': 346.9200134277344, 'text': " Trevor, I'm sorry."}, {'start': 346.9200134277344, 'end': 348.32000732421875, 'text': " You're not more Indian than me."}, {'start': 348.32000732421875, 'end': 349.32000732421875, 'text': " I was like, I'm sorry, what?"}, {'start': 349.32000732421875, 'end': 351.79998779296875, 'text': " He's like, yeah, you are not more Indian than me."}, {'start': 351.79998779296875, 'end': 352.6400146484375, 'text': ' I was like,'}, {'start': 352.6400146484375, 'end': 354.1199951171875, 'text': ' Kuch Kuch Hota Hai.'}, {'start': 356.239990234375, 'end': 357.0799865722656, 'text': ' What the hell is that?'}, {'start': 357.0799865722656, 'end': 357.8999938964844, 'text': ' Exactly.'}, {'start': 360.0, 'end': 361.3999938964844, 'text': " Don't tell me I'm not more Indian than you."}, {'start': 361.3999938964844, 'end': 362.4800109863281, 'text': ' You shut up.'}, {'start': 362.4800109863281, 'end': 363.760009765625, 'text': ' When the waiter comes in, you shut up.'}, {'start': 363.760009765625, 'end': 364.6000061035156, 'text': " He's like, I'm not gonna shut up."}, {'start': 364.6000061035156, 'end': 365.4200134277344, 'text': ' I was like, you shut up.'}, {'start': 365.4200134277344, 'end': 366.260009765625, 'text': " He's like, okay, fine."}, {'start': 366.260009765625, 'end': 367.3599853515625, 'text': ' Order, order then.'}, {'start': 367.3599853515625, 'end': 369.0799865722656, 'text': ' And the waiter walks over.'}, {'start': 369.0799865722656, 'end': 370.6000061035156, 'text': ' This beautiful Indian man.'}, {'start': 370.6000061035156, 'end': 372.9200134277344, 'text': " He's got his beautiful Indian garb, and he steps up."}, {'start': 372.9200134277344, 'end': 374.8399963378906, 'text': ' And I know, Steve, I can see him'}, {'start': 374.8399963378906, 'end': 377.5400085449219, 'text': ' questioning my authority out of the corner of my eye.'}, {'start': 378.5, 'end': 380.1400146484375, 'text': ' I wanted to show him that these were my people.'}, {'start': 380.1400146484375, 'end': 381.94000244140625, 'text': " And as the waiter got there, I didn't even let him speak."}, {'start': 381.94000244140625, 'end': 384.29998779296875, 'text': ' I just jumped up and I was like, good evening.'}, {'start': 385.9200134277344, 'end': 388.6199951171875, 'text': " I'm going to be ordering for the entire table, please."}, {'start': 392.739990234375, 'end': 395.8599853515625, 'text': ' Could we please have three garlic roll naans?'}, {'start': 395.8599853515625, 'end': 399.6199951171875, 'text': " We're going to have three Romali rotis."}, {'start': 399.6199951171875, 'end': 402.7799987792969, 'text': ' Give us one shahi paneer, one palak paneer.'}, {'start': 403.6400146484375, 'end': 404.4800109863281, 'text': ' You know what?'}, {'start': 404.4800109863281, 'end': 407.9200134277344, 'text': " We're going to have a Rogan Josh lamb, of course."}, {'start': 409.760009765625, 'end': 412.2799987792969, 'text': ' Could we also please have one butter chicken'}, {'start': 412.2799987792969, 'end': 414.0, 'text': ' for my Caucasian friends?'}, {'start': 419.6400146484375, 'end': 421.6400146484375, 'text': " And then we're going to have three samosas"}, {'start': 421.6400146484375, 'end': 424.7799987792969, 'text': ' and three mango lassies to wash it all down.'}, {'start': 424.7799987792969, 'end': 426.1199951171875, 'text': ' Thank you very much.'}, {'start': 427.44000244140625, 'end': 428.2799987792969, 'text': ' I crushed it.'}, {'start': 428.3800048828125, 'end': 429.5400085449219, 'text': ' I could feel it.'}, {'start': 430.94000244140625, 'end': 432.1400146484375, 'text': ' Everyone could feel it.'}, {'start': 434.29998779296875, 'end': 435.5400085449219, 'text': ' They could feel something.'}, {'start': 438.5400085449219, 'end': 439.94000244140625, 'text': ' Because the table went dead.'}, {'start': 442.29998779296875, 'end': 443.7799987792969, 'text': ' The waiter just stared at me.'}, {'start': 444.8599853515625, 'end': 446.70001220703125, 'text': ' At first I thought he was impressed.'}, {'start': 446.70001220703125, 'end': 448.5400085449219, 'text': ' Then I realized he was confused.'}, {'start': 451.6600036621094, 'end': 453.6600036621094, 'text': ' And this Indian man leans in.'}, {'start': 454.0799865722656, 'end': 456.1199951171875, 'text': " And looks me dead in the eye and he's like,"}, {'start': 458.44000244140625, 'end': 460.55999755859375, 'text': ' sorry, sir, could you repeat what you said?'}, {'start': 468.55999755859375, 'end': 470.3599853515625, 'text': ' I kind of hear what you were saying, right?'}, {'start': 470.3599853515625, 'end': 471.7200012207031, 'text': ' You got a bit of an accent.'}, {'start': 474.1199951171875, 'end': 475.7200012207031, 'text': ' And I was like, oh shit!'}, {'start': 478.20001220703125, 'end': 483.20001220703125, 'text': " And he's like, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no."}, {'start': 484.6400146484375, 'end': 485.79998779296875, 'text': " He's Scottish!"}, {'start': 487.6400146484375, 'end': 488.9599914550781, 'text': " I mean, I know he's Scottish."}, {'start': 488.9599914550781, 'end': 490.6000061035156, 'text': " I mean, we're in Scotland, he's Scottish,"}, {'start': 490.6000061035156, 'end': 491.6000061035156, 'text': " but it's like, he's Indian."}, {'start': 491.6000061035156, 'end': 493.0400085449219, 'text': " I didn't expect that, right?"}, {'start': 493.0400085449219, 'end': 493.8800048828125, 'text': ' Because the whole place is Indian.'}, {'start': 493.8800048828125, 'end': 495.2799987792969, 'text': " There's an Indian restaurant, the people eating,"}, {'start': 495.2799987792969, 'end': 496.9200134277344, 'text': " we're Indian, there's Indian gods on the wall."}, {'start': 496.9200134277344, 'end': 499.0, 'text': ' The guy was Indian, his beard was Indian,'}, {'start': 499.0, 'end': 500.2799987792969, 'text': ' but his mouth was Shrek.'}, {'start': 500.2799987792969, 'end': 501.4800109863281, 'text': " I didn't expect that."}, {'start': 503.8800048828125, 'end': 505.79998779296875, 'text': " And now he didn't understand me"}, {'start': 505.79998779296875, 'end': 507.67999267578125, 'text': ' because I trudeaued too much.'}, {'start': 510.3999938964844, 'end': 512.0800170898438, 'text': " I didn't need to try so hard."}, {'start': 514.6400146484375, 'end': 518.4000244140625, 'text': " But then I realized I also couldn't stop"}, {'start': 520.6400146484375, 'end': 522.1199951171875, 'text': ' because that would be racist.'}, {'start': 530.3200073242188, 'end': 535.3200073242188, 'text': " So now I've got the Scottish Indian man looking at me."}, {'start': 537.3599853515625, 'end': 539.5999755859375, 'text': " Everyone's quiet and he's like,"}, {'start': 539.5999755859375, 'end': 540.4400024414062, 'text': " if you don't mind, laddie,"}, {'start': 540.4400024414062, 'end': 543.2000122070312, 'text': ' could you order again a little slower this time, right?'}, {'start': 544.280029296875, 'end': 545.9199829101562, 'text': ' And then I hear, what, yourself?'}, {'start': 548.760009765625, 'end': 551.0, 'text': ' You want me to place the entire order again?'}, {'start': 553.719970703125, 'end': 556.47998046875, 'text': " Ah, if you don't mind, I'm ready whenever you are."}, {'start': 561.2000122070312, 'end': 562.8800048828125, 'text': ' You know, I think everybody can order'}, {'start': 562.8800048828125, 'end': 564.280029296875, 'text': ' for themselves at the table.'}, {'start': 566.0, 'end': 568.239990234375, 'text': " I don't think it's necessary for me to hold their hands."}, {'start': 568.239990234375, 'end': 570.52001953125, 'text': ' Everybody can order individually'}, {'start': 570.52001953125, 'end': 572.2000122070312, 'text': ' and we can go from there, okay?'}, {'start': 572.2000122070312, 'end': 573.2000122070312, 'text': ' We can go from there.'}, {'start': 573.739990234375, 'end': 574.8200073242188, 'text': ' And Steve was like, oh, I wish I could,'}, {'start': 574.8200073242188, 'end': 577.52001953125, 'text': " but I'm so afraid I might offend someone."}, {'start': 579.6599731445312, 'end': 581.8200073242188, 'text': ' I think my friend here should order for us.'}, {'start': 581.8200073242188, 'end': 583.7000122070312, 'text': ' Please, Trevor, go ahead.'}, {'start': 583.7000122070312, 'end': 584.5399780273438, 'text': ' Go ahead.'}, {'start': 584.5399780273438, 'end': 585.739990234375, 'text': " You're far more cultured than I am."}, {'start': 585.739990234375, 'end': 586.5800170898438, 'text': ' I said, no, no, no, no.'}, {'start': 586.5800170898438, 'end': 588.7000122070312, 'text': ' Steve, please, you can dry your hand.'}, {'start': 588.7000122070312, 'end': 590.0999755859375, 'text': " I'm sure you know exactly what you want."}, {'start': 590.0999755859375, 'end': 593.4600219726562, 'text': " He's like, no, but what if I say something embarrassing?"}, {'start': 593.4600219726562, 'end': 594.3400268554688, 'text': " The last thing I'd want to do"}, {'start': 594.3400268554688, 'end': 596.739990234375, 'text': " is offend another person's culture, Trevor."}, {'start': 596.739990234375, 'end': 598.8599853515625, 'text': " Said, no, you can't offend anybody."}, {'start': 598.8599853515625, 'end': 600.5800170898438, 'text': ' There are no mistakes here, okay?'}, {'start': 600.5800170898438, 'end': 601.9000244140625, 'text': ' We are all friends, okay?'}, {'start': 601.9199829101562, 'end': 603.760009765625, 'text': ' If anybody make a mistake, we forget about it.'}, {'start': 603.760009765625, 'end': 605.1599731445312, 'text': ' In fact, whatever happens today,'}, {'start': 605.1599731445312, 'end': 607.52001953125, 'text': " we're all going to forget about it, okay?"}, {'start': 607.52001953125, 'end': 609.0800170898438, 'text': ' Just order, just order.'}, {'start': 609.0800170898438, 'end': 611.0399780273438, 'text': " He's like, no, I wish I could."}, {'start': 611.0399780273438, 'end': 611.9600219726562, 'text': ' I really wish I could.'}, {'start': 611.9600219726562, 'end': 612.7999877929688, 'text': ' But Trevor, please go.'}, {'start': 612.7999877929688, 'end': 614.1199951171875, 'text': ' I said, no, no, you just order, Steve.'}, {'start': 614.1199951171875, 'end': 614.9600219726562, 'text': " He's like, oh, please, Trevor."}, {'start': 614.9600219726562, 'end': 616.4400024414062, 'text': ' I was like, order, bastard!'}, {'start': 621.0800170898438, 'end': 621.9199829101562, 'text': ' Just order!'}, {'start': 623.5999755859375, 'end': 625.2000122070312, 'text': ' The waiter was like, hey, hey, hey, hey,'}, {'start': 625.2000122070312, 'end': 627.9199829101562, 'text': " there's no need to fight amongst yourselves."}, {'start': 627.9199829101562, 'end': 631.3599853515625, 'text': " Look, clearly your friend's a little uncomfortable, right?"}, {'start': 631.3800048828125, 'end': 632.4600219726562, 'text': ' Just order for him.'}, {'start': 634.0999755859375, 'end': 636.3599853515625, 'text': " Like, yes, he's totally uncomfortable."}, {'start': 640.7000122070312, 'end': 645.260009765625, 'text': ' Okay, could we please have three Romali rotis'}, {'start': 645.260009765625, 'end': 649.5, 'text': ' and three garlic naan, one shahi paneer,'}, {'start': 649.5, 'end': 652.97998046875, 'text': ' one palak paneer, and could we also get a lamb Rogan Josh,'}, {'start': 652.97998046875, 'end': 657.1400146484375, 'text': " and we're also going to be having one butter chicken."}, {'start': 657.1400146484375, 'end': 659.5800170898438, 'text': ' For your Caucasian friends!'}, {'start': 659.5800170898438, 'end': 661.8400268554688, 'text': ' For anybody, for anybody.'}, {'start': 661.8400268554688, 'end': 663.6799926757812, 'text': ' Anybody can enjoy different types of curry.'}, {'start': 663.6799926757812, 'end': 664.8800048828125, 'text': " They don't all have to be spicy."}, {'start': 664.8800048828125, 'end': 667.5599975585938, 'text': " It doesn't matter, as long as you participate."}, {'start': 667.5599975585938, 'end': 668.9199829101562, 'text': ' There is no wrong way.'}, {'start': 668.9199829101562, 'end': 671.5599975585938, 'text': " Oh, you're so understanding, Trevor."}, {'start': 671.5599975585938, 'end': 673.0, 'text': ' Yes, yes, I am.'}, {'start': 674.7999877929688, 'end': 679.7999877929688, 'text': ' Could we also please get the zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz,'}, {'start': 689.5800170898438, 'end': 690.739990234375, 'text': ' zzz, zzz, zzz.'}, {'start': 694.8800048828125, 'end': 696.3200073242188, 'text': " What, you're gonna answer that?"}, {'start': 696.3200073242188, 'end': 697.1599731445312, 'text': ' Zzz, zzz.'}, {'start': 699.5999755859375, 'end': 701.1599731445312, 'text': ' No, they can call me back later.'}, {'start': 701.1599731445312, 'end': 702.739990234375, 'text': ' Zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz.'}, {'start': 706.9600219726562, 'end': 707.9600219726562, 'text': " He's like, it's getting awkward,"}, {'start': 707.9600219726562, 'end': 710.0399780273438, 'text': " just answer your phone, I'll wait."}, {'start': 710.0399780273438, 'end': 710.8800048828125, 'text': ' Zzz, zzz.'}, {'start': 711.719970703125, 'end': 712.5599975585938, 'text': ' Okay.'}, {'start': 712.5599975585938, 'end': 713.719970703125, 'text': ' Zzz, zzz, zzz.'}, {'start': 714.719970703125, 'end': 719.719970703125, 'text': ' Zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz, zzz.'}, {'start': 721.0999755859375, 'end': 721.9400024414062, 'text': ' Hello?'}, {'start': 728.4199829101562, 'end': 730.9199829101562, 'text': ' Yes, this is Trevor speaking, how can I help you?'}, {'start': 732.8200073242188, 'end': 733.9600219726562, 'text': ' Yes, no, the one and the same.'}, {'start': 733.9600219726562, 'end': 735.0599975585938, 'text': ' Can you get to the point?'}, {'start': 735.0599975585938, 'end': 736.9000244140625, 'text': " I can't talk right now, can you?"}, {'start': 736.9000244140625, 'end': 737.9000244140625, 'text': ' Can you tell me what you need?'}, {'start': 737.9000244140625, 'end': 739.7000122070312, 'text': " I can't speak for too long, can you?"}, {'start': 740.739990234375, 'end': 742.5800170898438, 'text': ' No, no, no, there is nothing wrong with my voice.'}, {'start': 742.5800170898438, 'end': 743.4400024414062, 'text': ' Can you just get?'}, {'start': 744.9199829101562, 'end': 745.9199829101562, 'text': ' No, no, everything is fine.'}, {'start': 745.9199829101562, 'end': 747.6400146484375, 'text': ' No, I have not been kidnapped, no.'}, {'start': 748.52001953125, 'end': 749.9199829101562, 'text': ' No, I have not been kidnapped.'}, {'start': 749.9199829101562, 'end': 751.6400146484375, 'text': ' Everything is fine, this is not a secret message.'}, {'start': 751.6400146484375, 'end': 753.5999755859375, 'text': ' Just, can you tell me what you need?'}, {'start': 753.5999755859375, 'end': 755.1599731445312, 'text': ' No, we can talk later then.'}, {'start': 755.1599731445312, 'end': 757.2000122070312, 'text': ' No, yeah, my voice is like this sometimes.'}, {'start': 757.2000122070312, 'end': 758.5599975585938, 'text': " Don't worry about that."}, {'start': 758.5599975585938, 'end': 759.4000244140625, 'text': ' Just wait.'}, {'start': 759.4000244140625, 'end': 761.0800170898438, 'text': ' No, and I think I know my voice.'}, {'start': 761.0800170898438, 'end': 762.280029296875, 'text': ' I think I know my voice also.'}, {'start': 762.280029296875, 'end': 764.0399780273438, 'text': " Yeah, well, I've been me my whole life, okay?"}, {'start': 764.0399780273438, 'end': 765.1599731445312, 'text': " I've been me my, okay, fine, fine."}, {'start': 765.1599731445312, 'end': 766.47998046875, 'text': " We'll talk later, we'll talk later."}, {'start': 766.47998046875, 'end': 767.3200073242188, 'text': ' Okay, okay, okay.'}, {'start': 767.3200073242188, 'end': 768.1599731445312, 'text': ' Love you too, mommy.'}, {'start': 768.1599731445312, 'end': 768.97998046875, 'text': ' Bye-bye.'}, {'start': 772.5800170898438, 'end': 777.5800170898438, 'text': " This is the most awkward meal I've ever had in my life."}, {'start': 781.1199951171875, 'end': 782.8599853515625, 'text': ' I barely ate a thing.'}, {'start': 784.8400268554688, 'end': 787.0800170898438, 'text': ' I sat there thinking about my life.'}, {'start': 789.9199829101562, 'end': 791.4199829101562, 'text': ' We finally get up to leave.'}, {'start': 792.7999877929688, 'end': 794.9199829101562, 'text': ' Steve is beaming from ear to ear.'}, {'start': 798.0, 'end': 799.4400024414062, 'text': ' They walk out ahead of me,'}, {'start': 799.4400024414062, 'end': 801.97998046875, 'text': " and as I'm leaving the restaurant,"}, {'start': 802.0, 'end': 802.9600219726562, 'text': ' the waiter waves us off.'}, {'start': 802.9600219726562, 'end': 804.3599853515625, 'text': " He's like, ah, good night, everybody."}, {'start': 804.3599853515625, 'end': 805.8400268554688, 'text': " He's like, have a great night."}, {'start': 805.8400268554688, 'end': 806.8400268554688, 'text': " And we wave at him, and he's like,"}, {'start': 806.8400268554688, 'end': 808.3200073242188, 'text': ' hey, excuse me, before you go,'}, {'start': 808.3200073242188, 'end': 811.239990234375, 'text': " hey, aren't you Trevor Noah?"}, {'start': 814.239990234375, 'end': 815.3599853515625, 'text': ' A comedian, right?'}, {'start': 817.3200073242188, 'end': 819.1599731445312, 'text': ' I was like, yeah, yeah, why?'}, {'start': 819.1599731445312, 'end': 822.6199951171875, 'text': " He's like, oh, no, because I totally got you, Trevor."}, {'start': 824.760009765625, 'end': 826.9199829101562, 'text': ' I totally got you, Trevor.'}, {'start': 828.7999877929688, 'end': 830.5599975585938, 'text': ' I was like, wait, wait, wait, what?'}, {'start': 830.5599975585938, 'end': 831.47998046875, 'text': " Wait, you're Indian?"}, {'start': 831.97998046875, 'end': 833.7000122070312, 'text': " He's like, of course I'm Indian."}, {'start': 833.7000122070312, 'end': 834.5399780273438, 'text': " Of course I'm Indian."}, {'start': 834.5399780273438, 'end': 835.8599853515625, 'text': ' All places Indian.'}, {'start': 835.8599853515625, 'end': 837.7000122070312, 'text': ' I totally got you, huh?'}, {'start': 837.7000122070312, 'end': 838.5399780273438, 'text': " I said, well, I don't understand."}, {'start': 838.5399780273438, 'end': 839.6199951171875, 'text': " He's like, you don't understand."}, {'start': 839.6199951171875, 'end': 840.4600219726562, 'text': ' I understand.'}, {'start': 840.4600219726562, 'end': 841.280029296875, 'text': ' You walked in.'}, {'start': 841.280029296875, 'end': 842.1199951171875, 'text': ' I said, look, Trevor Noah coming.'}, {'start': 842.1199951171875, 'end': 843.1799926757812, 'text': ' Then you start talking with accent.'}, {'start': 843.1799926757812, 'end': 844.3400268554688, 'text': ' I go, I also do accent.'}, {'start': 845.219970703125, 'end': 846.5, 'text': ' Then you were doing accent.'}, {'start': 846.5, 'end': 847.780029296875, 'text': ' Then I do accent.'}, {'start': 847.780029296875, 'end': 849.0999755859375, 'text': ' Then you were doing accent.'}, {'start': 849.0999755859375, 'end': 849.9400024414062, 'text': ' You make joke.'}, {'start': 849.9400024414062, 'end': 850.760009765625, 'text': ' I make joke.'}, {'start': 850.760009765625, 'end': 851.5999755859375, 'text': ' Do you like joke?'}, {'start': 851.5999755859375, 'end': 853.8599853515625, 'text': " I'm like, no, I don't like your joke."}, {'start': 853.8599853515625, 'end': 854.7000122070312, 'text': " I don't like your joke."}, {'start': 854.7000122070312, 'end': 855.8599853515625, 'text': ' I thought I was about to get canceled.'}, {'start': 855.8599853515625, 'end': 857.1400146484375, 'text': ' You see this shit?'}, {'start': 857.1400146484375, 'end': 858.2999877929688, 'text': " He's like, it was amazing."}, {'start': 858.2999877929688, 'end': 859.5399780273438, 'text': ' You were sweating so hard.'}, {'start': 859.5399780273438, 'end': 860.739990234375, 'text': ' Not from the curry, yeah?'}, {'start': 861.5399780273438, 'end': 863.3800048828125, 'text': ' That was so funny, Trevor.'}, {'start': 863.3800048828125, 'end': 864.260009765625, 'text': ' I was like, it was not funny.'}, {'start': 864.260009765625, 'end': 865.3400268554688, 'text': ' My friends were laughing at me.'}, {'start': 865.3400268554688, 'end': 866.1799926757812, 'text': " He's like, I know."}, {'start': 866.1799926757812, 'end': 867.6199951171875, 'text': " He's like, I wasn't scared, man."}, {'start': 867.6199951171875, 'end': 868.4600219726562, 'text': ' Why would you do that?'}, {'start': 868.4600219726562, 'end': 869.5800170898438, 'text': " He's like, because, Trevor,"}, {'start': 869.5800170898438, 'end': 872.97998046875, 'text': ' I take great joy in the pain and suffering of others.'}, {'start': 872.97998046875, 'end': 874.3800048828125, 'text': " It's called Shad in Brighter."}, {'start': 875.4199829101562, 'end': 877.9000244140625, 'text': ' Yo, Toronto, you guys have been amazing.'}, {'start': 877.9000244140625, 'end': 879.5399780273438, 'text': ' Thank you so much for coming out.'}, {'start': 881.1799926757812, 'end': 882.02001953125, 'text': ' I love you all.'}, {'start': 882.02001953125, 'end': 882.8400268554688, 'text': ' Good night.'}, {'start': 882.8400268554688, 'end': 887.8400268554688, 'text': " ♪ I'm out my world, I'm out my world, world, world ♪"}]
